# KN-013: A sulfur clock can become acid-limited before all substrate is consumed
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.0005mol
wait 30s
inspect v1
measure v1 ph
wait 300s
inspect v1
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
wait 30s
inspect v1
